{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09168","headline":"送郑端公弟移院常州 · 韦应物","name":"送郑端公弟移院常州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时瞻宪臣重，礼爲内兄全。\n公程傥见责，私爱信不愆。\n况昔陪朝列，今兹俱海壖。\n清觞方对酌，天书忽告迁。\n岂徒咫尺地，使我心思绵。\n应当自此始，归拜云台前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}